  "architecture_decisions": [
    "Route/invocation/SDK share private geometry/query helpers and stay in one cohesive host implementation module; no private header promoted to public.",
    "Immutable host/SDK/fixed-consumer interface files have distinct file ownership, including shared ABI source directory; implementation files remain separate/private.",
    "Test startup and test PAL are separate from main runner; explicit injected observer callbacks prevent reverse dependency cycles.",
    "Native implementations are test-scoped in this local matrix so test alternate provider dependencies cannot silently enter product builds. Promotion to product requires later explicit admission.",
    "Static C/C++ fixture symbols alone have hidden declarations for PIC address-taking; public fixed SDK and host headers remain byte-identical. No GOT import exception or compile-flag change."
  ],
